    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d450">

                <pb facs="0544" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg448"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Governor Foster to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >State of Louisiana, Executive Department</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Baton Rouge</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1899-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                                1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge receipt of
                    your favor confirming your telegram notifying me of the appointment by the
                    Italian Government of Marquis Romano to be acting consul.</p>
                <pb facs="0545" n="449" xml:id="pg449"/>
                <p>I have already communicated with him as such, and requested him to fix a day
                    suitable to his pleasure to meet me in his official capacity.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Murphy J. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
